ConvertTest
└── convertPrice
    ├── given a spot rate
    │   ├── it multiplies by the stored rate
    │   ├── it is not the reciprocal
    │   ├── it scales linearly across magnitudes
    │   ├── it handles a currency with a very small rate
    │   └── it carries the original text through
    ├── given a held rate
    │   ├── given the held rate covers this currency
    │   │   └── it converts at the held rate rather than spot
    │   └── given the held rate cannot cover this currency
    │       └── it refuses rather than falling back to spot
    ├── given a currency it has no rate for
    │   └── it refuses
    ├── when a precision is given
    │   └── it is carried into the rendering
    └── when a display unit is given
        └── it is carried into the rendering
    ├── given the rate for that currency is past the hard cap
    │   └── it refuses rather than converting at a stale rate
    ├── given the arithmetic does not produce a usable amount
        ├── it never yields a non-finite amount
        ├── given the rate overflows
        │   └── it refuses
        └── given the rate is negative
            └── it refuses
